2:[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Why CAT Preparation Needs Smarter Planning"}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":["The Common Admission Test (CAT) for IIM admission is unique among Indian competitive exams. It's not about how much you study — it's about ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"how smartly you prepare"}],". The exam tests:"]}],"\n",["$","ul",null,{"children":["\n",["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"VARC"}]," (Verbal Ability & Reading Comprehension)"]}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"DILR"}]," (Data Interpretation & Logical Reasoning)"]}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"QA"}]," (Quantitative Ability)"]}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":["With over 2.5 lakh aspirants competing for approximately 5,000 IIM seats across India, the challenge isn't just knowing the material — it's ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"speed, accuracy, and strategic test-taking"}],"."]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":["Most CAT toppers study 3-5 hours daily (much less than UPSC or NEET aspirants) — but those hours are ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"ruthlessly optimized"}],". That's where AI planning makes the biggest difference."]}],"\n",["$","h2",null,{"children":"The 6-Month CAT 2026 Master Plan"}],"\n",["$","h3",null,{"children":"Phase 1: Concept Building (Months 1-2: June - July 2026)"}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Focus:"}]," Build strong foundations in all three sections"]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":["$","strong",null,{"children":"Daily Study: 3-4 hours"}]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":["$","strong",null,{"children":"VARC (1 hour daily):"}]}],"\n",["$","ul",null,{"children":["\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"Read 2-3 long-form articles (The Economist, Aeon, scientific journals)"}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"Practice 1 RC passage with questions"}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"Learn 10 new vocabulary words through context (not rote memorization)"}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":["$","strong",null,{"children":"DILR (1 hour daily):"}]}],"\n",["$","ul",null,{"children":["\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"Study fundamental DI types: tables, graphs, caselets"}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"Practice LR sets: arrangements, grouping, puzzles"}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"Focus on understanding set structures, not speed"}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":["$","strong",null,{"children":"QA (1-2 hours daily):"}]}],"\n",["$","ul",null,{"children":["\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"Arithmetic: Percentages, Ratio, Time-Speed-Distance"}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"Number System fundamentals"}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"Algebra: Equations, Inequalities, Functions"}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"Geometry basics: Triangles, Circles, Coordinate Geometry"}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"How PlanBot Helps:"}]," The AI rotates between sections daily, ensuring you never neglect one area while binge-studying another. It also schedules reading time for VARC — the section most aspirants neglect until it's too late."]}],"\n",["$","h3",null,{"children":"Phase 2: Advanced Practice (Months 3-4: August - September 2026)"}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Focus:"}]," Solve higher-difficulty problems + develop speed"]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":["$","strong",null,{"children":"Daily Study: 4-5 hours"}]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":["$","strong",null,{"children":"Key activities:"}]}],"\n",["$","ul",null,{"children":["\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"Solve 30-40 problems daily across sections"}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"Timed sectional practice (20 questions in 40 minutes)"}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"Start solving CAT previous year papers (section-wise)"}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"Weekly sectional mock tests"}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":["$","strong",null,{"children":"Speed Development Techniques:"}]}],"\n",["$","ul",null,{"children":["\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"For QA: Develop calculation shortcuts (Vedic Math, mental math)"}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"For VARC: Practice speed reading (target 300+ WPM)"}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"For DILR: Learn to identify set difficulty in 30 seconds (skip hard sets)"}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"How PlanBot Helps:"}]," AI schedules timed practice sessions at increasing difficulty levels. The streak system ensures daily practice doesn't get skipped even when motivation dips."]}],"\n",["$","h3",null,{"children":"Phase 3: Mock Test Phase (Months 5-6: October - November 2026)"}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Focus:"}]," Full-length mocks + analysis + weak area repair"]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":["$","strong",null,{"children":"Daily Study: 4-5 hours"}]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":["$","strong",null,{"children":"Mock Test Schedule:"}]}],"\n",["$","ul",null,{"children":["\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"2 full-length mocks per week (Saturday + Wednesday)"}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"2 hours of mock analysis per test"}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"Remaining days: weak area focused practice"}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":["$","strong",null,{"children":"The Mock Analysis Framework:"}]}],"\n",["$","ol",null,{"children":["\n",["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Time Analysis:"}]," How long did each section take? Where did you waste time?"]}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Accuracy Analysis:"}]," What % of attempted questions were correct?"]}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Skip Analysis:"}]," Which questions should you have attempted? Which should you have skipped?"]}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Section Strategy:"}]," What's your optimal attempt order? (Many toppers do VARC → QA → DILR)"]}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":["$","strong",null,{"children":"Target Scores by Phase End:"}]}],"\n",["$","table",null,{"children":[["$","thead",null,{"children":["$","tr",null,{"children":[["$","th",null,{"children":"Section"}],["$","th",null,{"children":"95%ile Score Target"}],["$","th",null,{"children":"Time Limit"}]]}]}],["$","tbody",null,{"children":[["$","tr",null,{"children":[["$","td",null,{"children":"VARC"}],["$","td",null,{"children":"38-42 marks"}],["$","td",null,{"children":"40 minutes"}]]}],["$","tr",null,{"children":[["$","td",null,{"children":"DILR"}],["$","td",null,{"children":"28-32 marks"}],["$","td",null,{"children":"40 minutes"}]]}],["$","tr",null,{"children":[["$","td",null,{"children":"QA"}],["$","td",null,{"children":"38-42 marks"}],["$","td",null,{"children":"40 minutes"}]]}],["$","tr",null,{"children":[["$","td",null,{"children":["$","strong",null,{"children":"Total"}]}],["$","td",null,{"children":["$","strong",null,{"children":"104-116 marks"}]}],["$","td",null,{"children":["$","strong",null,{"children":"120 minutes"}]}]]}]]}]]}],"\n",["$","h2",null,{"children":"Section-Wise Expert Strategies"}],"\n",["$","h3",null,{"children":"VARC: The Reading Habit Section"}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Truth:"}]," You cannot cram VARC. It rewards years of reading habit. But 6 months of daily reading CAN make a significant difference."]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":["$","strong",null,{"children":"Daily reading targets:"}]}],"\n",["$","ul",null,{"children":["\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"1 article from The Economist or The Atlantic (1000+ words)"}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"1 editorial from The Hindu or Indian Express"}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"1 scientific/philosophical article from Aeon or Nautilus"}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":["$","strong",null,{"children":"VARC split:"}]}],"\n",["$","ul",null,{"children":["\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"Reading Comprehension: 70% of section weightage"}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"Verbal Ability (Para Jumbles, Summary, Odd Sentence): 30%"}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","h3",null,{"children":"DILR: The Strategy Section"}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"DILR is the most unpredictable CAT section."}]," Sets range from easy (solvable in 8 minutes) to nearly impossible (designed to waste 15+ minutes)."]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Golden Rule:"}]," Never spend more than 12 minutes on a single set. If you can't crack it in 12 minutes, skip and move on."]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":["$","strong",null,{"children":"Practice Sources:"}]}],"\n",["$","ul",null,{"children":["\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"CAT PYQs (2017-2025 — new format)"}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"LRDI sets from coaching materials"}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"Puzzles from competitive mathematics books"}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","h3",null,{"children":"QA: The Speed Section"}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"QA tests calculation speed as much as concept knowledge."}]," A student who knows the concept but takes 3 minutes per question will score lower than one who solves in 1.5 minutes with shortcuts."]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":["$","strong",null,{"children":"Speed techniques:"}]}],"\n",["$","ul",null,{"children":["\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"Vedic Math multiplication tricks"}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"Percentage to fraction conversions (memorize: 12.5% = 1/8, 37.5% = 3/8)"}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"Approximation for DI calculations"}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"Back-substitution for algebra problems"}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","h2",null,{"children":"The CAT Aspirant's Productivity Stack"}],"\n",["$","table",null,{"children":[["$","thead",null,{"children":["$","tr",null,{"children":[["$","th",null,{"children":"Tool"}],["$","th",null,{"children":"Purpose"}],["$","th",null,{"children":"Usage"}]]}]}],["$","tbody",null,{"children":[["$","tr",null,{"children":[["$","td",null,{"children":["$","strong",null,{"children":"PlanBot"}]}],["$","td",null,{"children":"Daily study schedule"}],["$","td",null,{"children":"AI-generated plan every morning"}]]}],["$","tr",null,{"children":[["$","td",null,{"children":["$","strong",null,{"children":"Takshzila/2IIM"}]}],["$","td",null,{"children":"Concept videos"}],["$","td",null,{"children":"Watch during concept phase"}]]}],["$","tr",null,{"children":[["$","td",null,{"children":["$","strong",null,{"children":"CAT PYQ apps"}]}],["$","td",null,{"children":"Problem practice"}],["$","td",null,{"children":"Sectional practice sessions"}]]}],["$","tr",null,{"children":[["$","td",null,{"children":["$","strong",null,{"children":"The Economist"}]}],["$","td",null,{"children":"VARC reading"}],["$","td",null,{"children":"Daily 1 article"}]]}],["$","tr",null,{"children":[["$","td",null,{"children":["$","strong",null,{"children":"Excel/Sheets"}]}],["$","td",null,{"children":"Mock test tracking"}],["$","td",null,{"children":"Analyze score trends"}]]}]]}]]}],"\n",["$","h2",null,{"children":"Working Professional CAT Strategy"}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":"Most CAT aspirants are working professionals with 8-10 hours committed to work. Here's how AI planning helps:"}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Available study time:"}]," 3-4 hours (split across morning + evening)"]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":["$","strong",null,{"children":"PlanBot-generated split:"}]}],"\n",["$","table",null,{"children":[["$","thead",null,{"children":["$","tr",null,{"children":[["$","th",null,{"children":"Time"}],["$","th",null,{"children":"Activity"}]]}]}],["$","tbody",null,{"children":[["$","tr",null,{"children":[["$","td",null,{"children":"6:00 - 7:00"}],["$","td",null,{"children":"QA problem practice (morning freshness for math)"}]]}],["$","tr",null,{"children":[["$","td",null,{"children":"7:00 - 7:30"}],["$","td",null,{"children":"Reading (VARC — article + vocabulary)"}]]}],["$","tr",null,{"children":[["$","td",null,{"children":"Work Day"}],["$","td",null,{"children":"8:30 - 6:30"}]]}],["$","tr",null,{"children":[["$","td",null,{"children":"19:30 - 20:00"}],["$","td",null,{"children":"VARC RC passage practice"}]]}],["$","tr",null,{"children":[["$","td",null,{"children":"20:30 - 21:30"}],["$","td",null,{"children":"DILR set practice"}]]}],["$","tr",null,{"children":[["$","td",null,{"children":"21:30 - 22:00"}],["$","td",null,{"children":"Review + PlanBot tomorrow's plan"}]]}]]}]]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Total:"}]," 3.5 hours of focused CAT preparation alongside a full-time job. PlanBot makes this possible by eliminating planning time and ensuring every minute counts."]}],"\n",["$","h2",null,{"children":"Frequently Asked Questions"}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Q: Can PlanBot create a complete CAT preparation plan?"}],"\nA: Yes. Tell PlanBot your CAT target, available study hours, and weak sections. The AI creates a daily schedule that rotates between VARC, DILR, and QA while maintaining proper reading habit development."]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Q: How many hours should I study daily for CAT?"}],"\nA: Working professionals: 3-4 hours. Full-time aspirants: 5-6 hours. Quality matters more than quantity for CAT. PlanBot optimizes your study hours for maximum sectional improvement."]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Q: Is 6 months enough for CAT preparation?"}],"\nA: Yes, 6 months is sufficient for most aspirants with a strong engineering/math background. For non-math backgrounds, 8-10 months is recommended. PlanBot adjusts the plan intensity based on your timeline."]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Q: Which CAT coaching is best alongside PlanBot?"}],"\nA: PlanBot is a scheduling tool, not a coaching platform. For content, consider 2IIM (free YouTube), Takshzila, Unacademy CAT, or career launcher. PlanBot tells you WHEN to study each topic; coaching teaches you HOW to solve."]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Q: Can PlanBot help with other MBA exams (XAT, SNAP, NMAT)?"}],"\nA: PlanBot works with any exam. Describe your target exam, syllabus, and timeline — the AI creates a personalized plan. Most MBA exam preparation overlaps significantly with CAT."]}],"\n",["$","hr",null,{}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":["$","em",null,{"children":["Start your IIM journey with AI-powered planning. ",["$","a",null,{"href":"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=cpm.planbot","children":"Download PlanBot free"}]," and let AI create your personalized CAT study schedule."]}]}]]
